        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"fa07dedc-8519-42ca-b025-bed7fdcdbd31\",\"review_text\":\"Comercial ads sould be at the same level with the rest of streaming This is for SkyShowtime in Romania .It's way to loud from the rest of streaming and function from settings don't have anny effect.\"},{\"review_id\":\"57001445-468d-40fb-bcfa-01873ae4881a\",\"review_text\":\"Depeands\"},{\"review_id\":\"5e9ec86b-eece-49be-b768-f3509b712305\",\"review_text\":\"It's a nice app to listen music\"},{\"review_id\":\"51d28bc8-af35-4709-977a-6dfc7febb0a1\",\"review_text\":\"This app is very nice\"},{\"review_id\":\"e80ef574-b480-409e-9603-7c8e05672e87\",\"review_text\":\"Frpjg😂👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"b3b6ac8e-c093-4e9c-9472-1305824560ac\",\"review_text\":\"Good Apple\"},{\"review_id\":\"f29918b8-2686-41fb-840b-f9c423cb5042\",\"review_text\":\"Recently they stopped Zee music songs which hits me hard😞\"},{\"review_id\":\"a0cbc9d6-51bb-46f0-9ba9-ad4f4593c266\",\"review_text\":\"A good music app when it works. I keep on running into issues where I click on songs in my liked music and they don't play. Also when I'm playing a playlist from my phone to the Xbox series x it randomly starts playing different music. This is ridiculous for a £10 a month subscription this needs to be fixed it's been happening for months. If these issues are not fixed soon I'm going to cancel my subscription and start using a different music subscription service.\"},{\"review_id\":\"238aadcd-381a-4477-b749-f457a2801bba\",\"review_text\":\"Mast ♥️\"},{\"review_id\":\"8ee5e181-21d4-41f6-a4d9-b00764e46100\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app ever seen...previously it was a very good app but now if u want to play a song of ur choice u need to pay money...they will force u to pay money...jio saavn is much better than this app\"}]}"
